    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This well located four bedroom mid-terrace residence presents an excellent opportunity for first time buyers, investors or those looking to downsize. Ideally situated within walking distance of Tralee town centre and the popular Tralee to Fenit Greenway, the property offers both convenience and easy access to a wide range of local amenities. The accommodation comprises four bedrooms, with one conveniently located on the ground floor, along with a living room and kitchen. The first floor provides three further bedrooms and the main bathroom. To the rear, the property benefits from a private garden with a generous sized shed, providing excellent additional storage. The garden also enjoys convenient access to the adjoining green area, offering an attractive outdoor amenity. The property enjoys a highly convenient location, with schools, shops, services and other everyday amenities all within easy reach. With its generous bedroom accommodation and excellent location, this property is well suited to a variety of purchasers and offers considerable potential as a comfortable home or investment opportunity."
      },
